/// Exclusions.mo: who is left out of the MENES holder snapshot, and for what.
///
/// Compiled in, so the module hash fixes the list: nobody can change it after the module is
/// installed except by an SNS upgrade proposal. An exclusion is per principal AND per kind:
/// a principal can be left out for the MENES it holds, for what it has staked in the MENES
/// sale canister, or both.
///
/// Every subaccount of a principal folds into it, so an exclusion covers all of them.

